{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Gentle, focused aromatherapy for intentional living</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Short aromatherapy sessions, custom blends, and guided planning that may support calm, focus, or rest. Book a focused session or build a personal blend." />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="layout-earthy">
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="/about.html">Who I Am</a>
        <a href="/services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="/blends.html">Elixirs</a>
        <a href="/pricing.html">Invest</a>
        <a href="/book.html" class="cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        <button id="navToggle" class="nav-toggle" aria-expanded="false">Menu</button>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-text">
          <h1 class="title">Scent-led clarity, designed for your rhythm</h1>
          <p class="subtitle">Short guided sessions and crafted blends that may support emotional grounding, clearer focus, and gentler rest. Book a focused session or design a personalized routine.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <a class="btn ghost" href="/about.html">Learn about our approach</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-pattern" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="pattern" viewBox="0 0 600 400" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
            <defs>
              <pattern id="p" x="0" y="0" width="40" height="40" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                <rect width="40" height="40" fill="#efe6d8"></rect>
                <path d="M0 20 C10 10,30 30,40 20" stroke="#d9bba3" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
              </pattern>
            </defs>
            <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p)"></rect>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="benefits wrap" id="benefits">
      <h2>How a short scent session may fit your life</h2>
      <div class="benefit-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>10–30 minute sessions</h3>
          <p>Practical sessions tailored to time you have — focused breathwork, scent orientation, and a follow-up plan you can use at home.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Blends you can repeat</h3>
          <p>Custom recipes and simple dilution guidance so you can recreate supportive blends safely at home.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Education-forward</h3>
          <p>Learn why a scent feels like it does, safe use basics, and how to adapt blends for pets or pregnancy with a careful approach.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="blend-builder wrap" id="blend-builder">
      <h2>Blend Builder — craft a simple elixir</h2>
      <p class="muted">Pick a mood, an application, and a skin-safety level; get a non-medical blend card and a safe dilution guide.</p>
      <form id="blendForm" class="form-grid" onsubmit="return false;">
        <label>
          Vibe
          <select id="vibe">
            <option value="calm">Calm & Grounding</option>
            <option value="focus">Focused Clarity</option>
            <option value="sleep">Sleep Ease</option>
            <option value="uplift">Gentle Uplift</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>
          Application
          <select id="application">
            <option value="roller_10">Roller (10 mL)</option>
            <option value="diffuser_100">Diffuser (100 mL water)</option>
            <option value="inhaler">Personal inhaler</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>
          Skin sensitivity
          <select id="sensitivity">
            <option value="normal">Normal</option>
            <option value="sensitive">Sensitive (use lower dilution)</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <div class="form-actions">
          <button id="buildBlend" class="btn primary">Create blend</button>
          <button id="resetBlend" class="btn ghost" type="button">Reset</button>
        </div>
      </form>

      <div id="blendResults" class="results">
        <div id="blendCard" class="blend-card" aria-live="polite"></div>
        <div id="dilutionGuide" class="dilution-guide" aria-live="polite"></div>
        <div class="results-actions">
          <button id="copyBlend" class="btn">Copy summary</button>
          <a id="downloadBlend" class="btn ghost" download="blend-card.txt">Download</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="session-planner wrap" id="session-planner">
      <h2>Session Planner — map a focused aromatherapy visit</h2>
      <p class="muted">Build a bespoke session plan and export a plain-text summary you can share when booking.</p>

      <form id="plannerForm" onsubmit="return false;" class="planner-grid">
        <label>
          Primary intention
          <select id="intention">
            <option value="calm">Calm & ground</option>
            <option value="clarity">Clarify thinking</option>
            <option value="rest">Ease into sleep</option>
            <option value="energy">Gentle uplift</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>
          Session length
          <select id="length">
            <option value="15">15 minutes</option>
            <option value="30">30 minutes</option>
            <option value="60">60 minutes</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>
          Focus area
          <input id="focusArea" placeholder="e.g., stress, exam prep, evening routine" />
        </label>
        <label>
          Format
          <select id="format">
            <option value="remote">Remote (guided)</option>
            <option value="in_person">In person</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>
          Follow-up preference
          <select id="followup">
            <option value="blend">Blend recipe + notes</option>
            <option value="mini-plan">Short daily micro-practice</option>
            <option value="both">Both</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <div class="form-actions">
          <button id="buildPlan" class="btn primary">Generate plan</button>
          <button id="resetPlan" class="btn ghost" type="button">Clear</button>
        </div>
      </form>

      <div id="planResult" class="plan-result" aria-live="polite">
        <textarea id="planSummary" readonly rows="8" aria-label="Session plan summary"></textarea>
        <div class="results-actions">
          <button id="copyPlan" class="btn">Copy plan</button>
          <a id="downloadPlan" class="btn ghost" download="session-plan.txt">Download</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </section>

    <section class="process wrap" id="process">
      <h2>How an intensive session unfolds</h2>
      <ol class="process-list">
        <li><strong>Intake & intention:</strong> Brief intake, establish what you want from this session and any safety notes.</li>
        <li><strong>Scent selection:</strong> Choose from curated oils; I explain properties and safety considerations.</li>
        <li><strong>Guided practice:</strong> 10–40 minutes of guided breathwork, scent orientation, and attunement.</li>
        <li><strong>Aftercare:</strong> A clear, plain-text plan—blend recipe, dilution guide, and micro-practice you can repeat.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="social-proof wrap" id="social-proof">
      <h2>Practitioner reflections</h2>
      <blockquote>"Practically useful and surprisingly gentle — the focus session left me with tools I still use." — A client in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</blockquote>
    </section>

    <section class="faq wrap" id="faq">
      <h2>FAQ — safety and common questions</h2>
      <div class="qa">
        <h3>Do these sessions treat medical conditions?</h3>
        <p>No. Aromatherapy in these sessions is educational and supportive and may support wellbeing. It is not medical care. Seek licensed medical advice for diagnosable conditions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="qa">
        <h3>What about dilution and patch testing?</h3>
        <p>All blend cards include recommended dilution ranges and a simple patch test: apply a small amount of diluted blend to an inner forearm and wait 24 hours. If irritation occurs, discontinue use.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="qa">
        <h3>Are there pet or pregnancy cautions?</h3>
        <p>Yes. Some oils may affect pets or be contraindicated during pregnancy. Any blend advice is safety-forward. Inform me if you are pregnant, breastfeeding, or have pets so recommendations can be adjusted.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="qa">
        <h3>How should I store blends?</h3>
        <p>Store blends upright in dark glass containers, away from heat and sunlight, and label with the dilution date. Use within a recommended timeframe included on each card.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta wrap" id="final-cta">
      <h2>Ready to design a session or blend?</h2>
      <p class="muted">Save time at booking by exporting your session plan and attaching it to your booking note.</p>
      <a class="btn primary large" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">Schedule an intensive visit</a>
      <p class="contact">Questions? Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap">
      <small>&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}}. Based in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.</small>
      <nav class="footer-nav">
        <a href="/contact.html">Connect</a>
        <a href="/shop.html">Shop</a>
        <a href="/privacy.html">Privacy</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
